        "doi": "10.1175/1520-0493(1996)124<2046:MFFSLT>2.0.CO;2"
      },
      {
        "citation": "Colella, P., & Sekora, M. D. (2008). A limiter for PPM that preserves accuracy at smooth extrema. Journal of Computational Physics, 227(15), 7069-7076.",
