      },
      {
        "citation": "Williamson, D. L., Drake, J. B., Hack, J. J., Jakob, R., & Swarztrauber, P. N. (1992). A standard test set for numerical approximations to the shallow water equations in spherical geometry. Journal of Computational Physics, 102(1), 211-224. (Spherical lat-lon metric factors for the zonal flux divergence.)",
