      },
      {
        "citation": "LeVeque, R. J. (2002). Finite Volume Methods for Hyperbolic Problems. Cambridge University Press. Section 4.1 (the donor-cell upwind flux; the upwind selection is the same whatever sub-grid reconstruction supplies the two one-sided face values)."
      }
    ]
